        "startingPosition": "Stand about hip-width with the bar on the floor close to the shins and take a self-selected wide overhand snatch grip.",
        "movement": "Keep the bar close through the first pull and rebend, extend the hips, knees, and ankles rapidly and shrug, then bend the elbows to pull under.",
