        "returnPhase": "Stand fully from the overhead squat, then return the bar to the floor before the next repetition.",
        "controlledJoints": "Complete the lower-body pull before pulling under and control the upper-arm, shoulder-blade, elbow, hip, knee, and ankle positions in the receive.",
